* Tokenised EU\nMoney Market Funds
** Applicable regimes
*** Not MiCA: financial instrument, Art. 2(4)(a)
*** MiCA "funds" = money (PSD2)
*** MMFR + UCITS / AIFMD
*** MiFID II distribution
*** National register law (French DEEP)
*** DLT Pilot only for venues
** Architectures
*** On-chain legal register (Spiko)
*** DLT share class (Amundi / CACEIS)
*** Mirror of TA register (BlackRock / Kinexys)
** Dealing price (Art. 33)
*** VNAV at variable NAV
*** CNAV at constant NAV
*** LVNAV 20 bp switch
*** Orders 24/7, settlement at struck NAV
left side
** Liquidity tools (Art. 34)
*** CNAV and LVNAV only
*** Board decision, reported
*** Gate 10 % per day, fund-wide
*** Suspension max 15 working days
** Holders (Art. 27, 37)
*** Contracts and pools as one holder
*** Whitelisting onboarded investors
*** Holder data for reporting
** External support (Art. 35)
*** Sponsor redemption facility
*** Sponsor-funded price floor
*** Stable-price wrapper
** Assets and disclosure
*** EMT not an eligible asset (Art. 9)
*** Front end = marketing (Art. 36)
*** No "stablecoin" framing
** MiCA reserves
*** Commission: MMFs as HLFI
*** EBA opinions Oct 2025 object
